    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d62">

                <pb facs="0117" n="45" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg45"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5072/33.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Hutchinson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-05-03"><hi rendition="#italic">May 3,
                        1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Informs him that the President directs that he express to His Majesty, the Czar,
                    felicitations of the President upon the admission <pb facs="0118" n="46"
                        xml:id="pg46"/> of Bulgaria to the community of sovereign and independent
                    States. Adds that the Government and people of the United States, in cordial
                    friendship for Bulgaria, offer good wishes for the welfare and happiness of His
                    Majesty and the people of Bulgaria.</p>
            </div>
